    # uninitialised variable does not change its initializedness" — which is a rule about
    # raw references SPECIFICALLY. The row stands today on `&mut x` over the same
    # uninitialised binding, which rustc also refuses but by the ordinary borrow rule. To
    # make it a row: land the syntax, re-port the upstream line, and see whether the
